PASS  SSH 소스가 /32 단일 IP (121.135.181.35/32)
PASS  외부 GET /health = 200 OK
PASS  외부 GET / = 200
모든 검증 통과
== dry-run: B3-1 인스턴스(i-04dd8916b77900977, Project=B3-1) vs FireView(i-0f29938e558d1e55c)
terminate B3-1 => DryRunOperation
terminate FireView => UnauthorizedOperation
reboot B3-1 => DryRunOperation
reboot FireView => UnauthorizedOperation

